A man from the Grave “burned” his girlfriend from Kostomlat
A man from the Grave inadvertently helped the officers secure his nationally sought-after girlfriend from Kostomlat, to whom an arrest warrant had been issued.
He summoned them to it himself.
He wented a detour on it.
